# Razorpay webhook testing with ngrok
#
# 1. Install ngrok: https://ngrok.com/download
# 2. Start the backend: uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000
# 3. Start ngrok: ngrok http 8000
# 4. Copy the HTTPS URL (e.g. https://abc123.ngrok-free.app)
# 5. Set it as your Razorpay webhook URL:
#    - Go to https://dashboard.razorpay.com/app/webhooks
#    - Add webhook → paste the ngrok URL + /webhooks/razorpay
#    - Select events: payment.captured, payment.failed
# 6. Set RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET in your .env (use the secret from Razorpay dashboard)
#
# Test with:
#   python -m buyer_agent "buy chicken biriyani under 500" -v
#
# Or send a test event from Razorpay dashboard → Webhooks → Test Event

# Add this to your .env file:
# RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your_webhook_secret_from_razorpay_dashboard
